# Octarine Engine - ThreadSanitizer (TSan) suppressions for 3rd-party libraries

# SDL3 Linux D-Bus client (SDL_Init / SDL_Quit -> dbus_connection_close in libdbus-1.so.3):
# libdbus-1 acquires internal connection and dispatch/slot mutexes in opposite orders
# between initialization and connection teardown on the main thread.
# NOTE: Do NOT use `called_from_lib:libdbus-1.so` here; SDL3 is statically linked and
# x86-64 tail-called `pthread_mutex_unlock` from `dbus_message_unref` returns directly
# into `SDL_DBus_QueryPropertyOnConnection`, causing asymmetric lock/unlock tracking.
deadlock:libdbus-1.so
deadlock:dbus_connection_close
